== Create a Custom Dashboard

Create a custom dashboard in Anypoint Monitoring.

. In the sidebar, click *Custom dashboards*. 
. Click *+ New Dashboard*.
. Add and configure a chart for your dashboard.
. Click *Save Changes*.
. In the *Save as* dialog, enter a *New name*, and click *Save*. 
