== View a Custom Dashboard

You can view custom dashboards for apps deployed to CloudHub and to hybrid targets in *Custom dashboards*.

. In the sidebar, click *Custom dashboards* in the sidebar to display custom dashboards. 
. Use search to find the dashboard.
. In the custom dashboard list, click the dashboard. 

